owspan="1" colspan="1"/><td align="center" rowspan="1" colspan="1"/><td align="center" rowspan="1" colspan="1"/><td align="center" rowspan="1" colspan="1">9.6</td><td align="left" rowspan="1" colspan="1"/><td align="center" rowspan="1" colspan="1"/><td align="left" rowspan="1" colspan="1"/><td align="center" rowspan="1" colspan="1"/><td align="right" rowspan="1" colspan="1"/></tr></tbody></table><table-wrap-foot><fn id="tfn11-ehp0115-000248"><p>Abbreviations: 2,4-D, 2,4-dichlorophenoxyacetic acid; MCPP, mecoprop.</p></fn><fn id="tfn12-ehp0115-000248"><label>a</label><p><xref ref-type="bibr" rid="b26-ehp0115-000248">Hodge and Rafter (1992a)</xref>.</p></fn><fn id="tfn13-ehp0115-000248"><label>b</label><p>Sales divided by unit price.</p></fn><fn id="tfn14-ehp0115-000248"><label>c</label><p>Meister Publishing Company manuals (<xref ref-type="bibr" rid="b5-ehp0115-000248">Anonymous 1999a</xref>, <xref ref-type="bibr" rid="b6-ehp0115-000248">1999b</xref>, <xref ref-type="bibr" rid="b8-ehp0115-000248">2003</xref>), C&#x00026;P Press publications (<xref ref-type="bibr" rid="b3-ehp0115-000248">Anonymous 1994</xref>, <xref ref-type="bibr" rid="b4-ehp0115-000248">1995</xref>; <xref ref-type="bibr" rid="b11-ehp0115-000248">C&#x00026;P Press 2004</xref>).</p></fn><fn id="tfn15-ehp0115-000248"><label>d</label><p>Gallons used divided by application rate in gallons per acre.</p></fn><fn id="tfn16-ehp0115-000248"><label>e</label><p>Assigning each product&#x02019;s acres treated to all of the active ingredients it contains.</p></fn><fn id="tfn17-ehp0115-000248"><label>f</label><p>Eliminating duplicates.</p></fn><fn id="tfn18-ehp0115-000248"><label>g</label><p>Combining active ingredient acres treated across all products in which it appears.</p></fn><fn id="tfn19-ehp0115-000248"><label>h</label><p>Dividing each active ingredient&#x02019;s acres treated by the total number of acres treated.</p></fn></table-wrap-foot></table-wrap><table-wrap id="t6-ehp0115-000248" position="float"><lab